    |        ^^^^
  --> tests/ui/effects/module_cap_ceiling_is_e0712.jet:3:1
    |
  3 | #FX(IO)
    | ^^^^^^^ module `report` is capped here
 Why: The module's cap allows only `IO` in every function inside it, even through a call
 Fix: Add `FS.Read` to the module's `#FX(…)` cap, or move that work out of module `report`
 Denial: invocation
 Call chain: load
 Scope chain: module report
