Error [jet.ProhibitedEffectReached]: `hush` reaches the `IO` effect, which module `quiet` denies
  --> tests/ui/effects/module_cap_ceiling_is_e0712.jet:9:12
    |
  9 |         fn hush() { print("x") }
    |            ^^^^
  --> tests/ui/effects/module_cap_ceiling_is_e0712.jet:7:5
