  7 |     #FX(!IO)
    |     ^^^^^^^^ module `quiet` is capped here
 Why: The module's `#FX(…)` cap denies `IO` to every function inside it and every callee it can reach
 Fix: Remove the call that introduces `IO`, move `hush` out of module `quiet`, or drop `!IO` from the module's `#FX(…)` cap
 Denial: invocation
 Call chain: hush
 Scope chain: module quiet
